Dear Applicants,

Please be advised that the maximum award for the FY2026 Community Development Grant cycle has been revised from $85,000 to $82,500 per project. This adjustment reflects updated program funding allocations and applies to all applications currently in preparation.

We apologize for any inconvenience and encourage applicants to adjust their budgets accordingly. If you have questions, contact a.okafor@fieldstone-fdn.org.

